This entry fixes the sha256 of an addendum to the pre-registration document named in amends, written before the first measurement it applies to. The addendum stays private until it is published with that document; anyone given it can recompute the sha256 above.
Establishes: that a document with this sha256 existed no later than the block this entry is anchored to.
Does not establish: anything about the content of the document before it is published.
